      <p class="mt-3 text-cream/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">Artisan home bakery from Kilakarai. Small-batch breads, cakes, cupcakes & cookies — baked fresh every morning with love.</p>
    </div>
    <div id="about">
      <p class="font-serif text-xl font-bold mb-3">Visit Us</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-cream/85">📍Kilakarai, Tamil Nadu, India</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-cream/85 mt-1">📞 <a class="underline" href="tel:+917845550886">+91 7845550886</a> (Call / WhatsApp)</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-cream/85 mt-1">🕘 Open daily · 9 AM – 9 PM</p>
      <a class="inline-block mt-4 bg-cream text-wine font-semibold px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm" href="https://wa.me/917845550886?text=Hi%20Creamy.in!%20I%20want%20to%20order." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="font-serif text-xl font-bold mb-3">Quick Links</p>
